extends ../../layouts/dashboard

block config
  - pageName = "Typography"
  - pageUrl = "pages/typography"

block content
  .mb-3
    h1.h3.d-inline.align-middle Typography
    span.badge.bg-primary.ms-2.align-middle Text Styles

  p.text-body-secondary
    | Discover the premium typography scales and font styling guidelines used throughout the PiruAdmin dashboard.

  .row
    .col-12.col-lg-6
      .card.mb-4
        .card-header
          h5.card-title.mb-0 Standard Headings
          p.card-subtitle.text-body-secondary.small.mb-0 Standard HTML headings styled with perfect visual proportions.
        .card-body
          .mb-3
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Heading 1 (2.03rem)
            h1.mb-0.fw-bold Heading 1
          hr.my-3
          .mb-3
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Heading 2 (1.62rem)
            h2.mb-0.fw-bold Heading 2
          hr.my-3
          .mb-3
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Heading 3 (1.35rem)
            h3.mb-0.fw-bold Heading 3
          hr.my-3
          .mb-3
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Heading 4 (1.13rem)
            h4.mb-0.fw-semibold Heading 4
          hr.my-3
          .mb-3
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Heading 5 (1.01rem)
            h5.mb-0.fw-semibold Heading 5
          hr.my-3
          .mb-0
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Heading 6 (0.875rem)
            h6.mb-0.fw-semibold Heading 6

    .col-12.col-lg-6
      .card.mb-4
        .card-header
          h5.card-title.mb-0 Display Headings & Lead
          p.card-subtitle.text-body-secondary.small.mb-0 Large display headings when extra visual emphasis is required.
        .card-body
          .mb-3
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Display 1
            h1.display-1.mb-0.fw-bold D1
          hr.my-3
          .mb-3
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Display 4
            h1.display-4.mb-0.fw-bold D4
          hr.my-3
          .mb-0
            span.small.text-body-secondary.d-block.mb-1 Lead Paragraph
            p.lead.mb-0
              | This is a lead paragraph. It stands out with a slightly larger font size and lighter weight for key intro texts.

  .row
    .col-12
      .card
        .card-header
          h5.card-title.mb-0 Inline Text Elements & Utilities
          p.card-subtitle.text-body-secondary.small.mb-0 Helper classes for styling and aligning inline paragraph text.
        .card-body
          .row.g-4
            .col-12.col-md-6
              h6.fw-bold.mb-3 Styled Paragraphs & Mutes
              p.mb-2 You can use the mark tag to <mark>highlight</mark> text.
              p.text-decoration-underline.mb-2 This line of text will render as underlined.
              p.mb-2 <small>This line of text is meant to be treated as fine print.</small>
              p.fw-bold.mb-2 This line rendered as bold text.
              p.fst-italic.mb-2 This line rendered as italicized text.
              p.text-body-secondary.mb-0 This is a secondary muted paragraph text.

            .col-12.col-md-6
              h6.fw-bold.mb-3 Blockquotes & Lists
              blockquote.blockquote.border-start.ps-3.py-1.mb-4
                p.mb-1 "Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication."
                footer.blockquote-footer.small.mt-0
                  | Leonardo da Vinci in 
                  cite(title="Source Title") Art & Design
              
              ul.list-inline.mb-0
                li.list-inline-item.badge.bg-primary Inline Item 1
                li.list-inline-item.badge.bg-secondary Inline Item 2
                li.list-inline-item.badge.bg-success Inline Item 3
